  "details": "Please support logging in with Discord and Google accounts, when running the Steam (Android) build of VRChat on Steam Frame.\n\nThe currently offered options on Steam Frame are VRChat and Steam accounts only. On Windows (PC/PCVR), one can login with a VRChat account, Steam, Discord or Google.\n\n- Screenshot 1: VRChat.apk (Manifest 7611758058959841312) from Steam depot 438102, running on an Android smart phone in Monado runtime with OpenXR Runtime Broker (due to lack of access to a Steam Frame developer kit).\n\n- Screenshot 2: VRChat 2026.3.3 (OPEN BETA) `Build 1912`.",
